@page "/home/aboutus"

<PageTitle>About Us | Bagheera's Dream</PageTitle>

<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description"
          content="Erfahren Sie mehr über Bagheera's Dream, unsere Leidenschaft für British Shorthair Katzen, unsere Zuchtphilosophie und unsere Liebe zu dieser besonderen Rasse." />

    <link rel="canonical" href="https://bagheerasdream.de/home/aboutus" />

    <meta property="og:title"
          content="About Us | Bagheera's Dream" />

    <meta property="og:description"
          content="Discover the story behind Bagheera's Dream, our passion for British Shorthair cats and the values that guide our cattery." />

    <meta property="og:url"
          content="https://bagheerasdream.de/home/aboutus" />

    <meta property="og:image"
          content="https://bagheerasdream.de/images/home/2.png" />

    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
</HeadContent>

<section class="about-page">

    <!-- HERO -->

    <header class="about-hero">

        <span class="section-eyebrow">
            THE STORY BEHIND BAGHEERA'S DREAM
        </span>

        <h1>A LOVE FOR <span>BRITISH SHORTHAIRS</span></h1>

        <p>
            More than a cattery. A passion built around beautiful cats,
            wonderful personalities and the love they bring into our lives.
        </p>

    </header>


    <!-- OUR STORY -->

    <section class="about-story">

        <div class="about-story-visual">
            <div class="about-story-frame">
                <img src="/images/home/aboutus1.png"
                     alt="Our British Shorthair cats"
                     class="about-story-photo" />
            </div>

            <div class="about-story-caption">
                <span>01 — OUR STORY</span>
                <span>BAGHEERA'S DREAM</span>
            </div>

            <div class="about-story-decoration"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-story-content">

            <span class="section-eyebrow">
                GET TO KNOW US
            </span>

            <h2>HOW WE BECAME <span>BAGHEERA'S DREAM</span></h2>

            <p> 
                Twelve years ago, my journey into the wonderful world of British Shorthairs began
                with just two cats and a heart full of love for the breed. What started as a small
                passion slowly grew into something much bigger – a family, a lifelong commitment
                and a home filled with beautiful cats, each with their own personality and place in my heart.
            </p>
        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- OUR PHILOSOPHY -->

    <section class="about-philosophy">

        <div class="philosophy-header">

            <span class="section-eyebrow">
                WHAT MATTERS TO US
            </span>

            <h2>OUR <span>PHILOSOPHY</span></h2>

            <p>
                The values that guide everything we do.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="philosophy-grid">

            <article class="philosophy-card">

                <span class="philosophy-icon">♡</span>

                <h3>Love & Care</h3>

                <p>
                    Every cat deserves affection, attention
                    and a caring environment.
                </p>

            </article>


            <article class="philosophy-card">

                <span class="philosophy-icon">✧</span>

                <h3>Health & Wellbeing</h3>

                <p>
                    The health and wellbeing of our cats
                    always come first.
                </p>

            </article>


            <article class="philosophy-card">

                <span class="philosophy-icon">❋</span>

                <h3>Responsible Breeding</h3>

                <p>
                    We believe in thoughtful decisions
                    and responsible breeding practices.
                </p>

            </article>


            <article class="philosophy-card">

                <span class="philosophy-icon">♡</span>

                <h3>Happy Families</h3>

                <p>
                    Our wish is for every kitten to find
                    a loving and caring forever home.
                </p>

            </article>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- OUR BREED -->

    <section class="about-breed">

        <div class="about-breed-content">

            <span class="section-eyebrow">
                GET TO KNOW US
            </span>

            <h2>ONE FAMILY, EVERY <span>CAT CHERISHED</span></h2>

            <p>
                Today, our cattery is home to a big family of both breeding and non-breeding cats.
                For me, every cat matters, regardless of whether they are part of the breeding programme
                or simply enjoying their well-deserved life as beloved family members.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-story-visual">
            <div class="about-story-frame">
                <img src="/images/home/aboutus2.jpg"
                     alt="Our British Shorthair cats"
                     class="about-story-photo" />
            </div>

            <div class="about-story-caption">
                <span>Felidae e.V. exhibition in August, 2024 in Dessau Rosslau, Germany.</span>
                <span>DAY 2</span>
            </div>

            <div class="about-story-decoration"></div>
        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- CLOSING CTA -->

    <section class="about-cta">

        <span class="section-eyebrow">
            WELCOME TO OUR WORLD
        </span>

        <h2>DISCOVER THE WORLD OF <span>BAGHEERA'S DREAM</span></h2>

        <p>
            We invite you to meet our beautiful cats
            and discover the little ones who make our family special.
        </p>

        <a href="/litters" class="about-cta-button">
            DISCOVER OUR LITTERS
        </a>

    </section>

</section>